      "updated": 1792165891268,
      "created": 1791828203372,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n- Source-based \n  - (No aggregation into object LCs)\n\n- Aggregation step not yet written, but\ncan be like PPDB but easier (not\naggregating LCs)\n  - So it's just repartitioning! \n\n- Generated by notebook:\n.../notebooks_lf/blob/main/sprints/202\n6/07_01/alert_archive.ipynb\n\n- Data source: avro alerts from USDF\n(still?)\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "EMhhm3JRupWS__dVdWRCM",
      "originalText": "\n- Source-based \n  - (No aggregation into object LCs)\n\n- Aggregation step not yet written, but can be like PPDB but easier (not aggregating LCs)\n  - So it's just repartitioning! \n\n- Generated by notebook: .../notebooks_lf/blob/main/sprints/2026/07_01/alert_archive.ipynb\n\n- Data source: avro alerts from USDF (still?)\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
